<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 higher. Demand moderate on a lightto moderate movement. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			    Country			    Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 LBS.  57.00-58.50, few 59.00	58.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 LBS.  52.00-57.00			 Few 60.00</p>
<p>	   210-230 LBS.  47.50-52.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to Firm, Some 1.00 Higher. Top 49.00. US 1-3   300-500 LBS.  42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 LBS.  45.00-47.00</p>
<p>few over 600 LBS.  48.00-49.00</p>
